items.Weapon_Daggers_Oblivions_Tithe.name=The Diddlers
items.Weapon_Daggers_Oblivions_Tithe.description=Crimson trails follow the blades in motion. Daedric Venom: direct hits add 1 stack (max 10). Each stack deals 2 Poison damage/sec; hits refresh 6 seconds. Maximum 20 base Poison DPS. Poison resistance and immunity apply. Q: Razorstrike. \n\nForged in reverence to the Daedric Princes, these twin fangs carry a whisper from beyond the gates of Oblivion. Every crimson arc writes another blasphemy into living flesh; every wound deepens a patient venom. Their maker prayed for mercy. Something answered.
